# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Generated by `tauri android init` from tauri.conf.json and regenerated
# on demand -- committing it means every future init produces a diff
# nobody wrote. The Kotlin we actually author will live outside this
# tree so it survives regeneration.
src-tauri/gen/

# Android build outputs
src-tauri/target/
**/build/
.gradle/
local.properties
*.apk
# apksigner's v4 signature block, written beside the APK.
*.idsig
*.aab
*.keystore

# The Android release signing key and its password.
#
# Never commit either. Android identifies an app by its signing key, so
# once a build is installed anywhere, every future update MUST be signed
# with this exact key -- losing it means a new package the tablet treats
# as a different app, with no upgrade path. Back it up somewhere outside
# this machine.
.signing/
